Fonts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The font files are not in the source tree. next/font (apps/web/app/layout.tsx)
downloads them from Google Fonts when the web image is built and serves them
from the panel itself, so a built image contains them:

  Fira Sans              The Mozilla Foundation and Telefonica S.A.
                         https://github.com/mozilla/Fira
  Fira Code              The Fira Code Project Authors
                         https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode
  Atkinson Hyperlegible  Braille Institute of America, Inc.
                         https://www.brailleinstitute.org/freefont/

All three are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org). The fonts are used unmodified and are not sold
by themselves.

